      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rosh_HaAyin",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Hiking trails weave through ancient sites like Khirbet a-Dwyer and the Izbet Tzarta mound, offering glimpses of millennia.",
